  "content": "<p>英文：</p><p>此附加组件通过Berezka API模组，将<strong>TaCZ</strong>物品添加到战利品箱中。现在，在探索建筑时，你将能找到包含<strong>TaCZ</strong>物品的独特战利品！</p><p>🔹 <strong>支持的模组</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-city\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>The Lost City</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-aviation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Aviation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-modern-houses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Modern Houses</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horror-structures-by-berezka\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horror Structures (by Berezka)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/old-ruin-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Old Ruin Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezkas-save-place\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka's Bunkers</a></li>\n</ul><p>💬 加入Discord服务器以获取更新、反馈和建议：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>俄文：</p><p>此附加组件通过<strong>Berezka API</strong>模组，将<strong>TaCZ</strong>物品添加到生成的箱子中。现在，在探索废弃城市和其他建筑时，你将能找到包含<strong>TaCZ</strong>物品的独特战利品！</p><p>🔹 <strong>支持的模组</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-city\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>The Lost City</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-aviation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Aviation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-modern-houses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Modern Houses</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horror-structures-by-berezka\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horror Structures (by Berezka)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/old-ruin-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Old Ruin Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezkas-save-place\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka's Bunkers</a></li>\n</ul><p>💬 加入我们的Discord服务器或Telegram频道，以关注更新、报告错误和提出想法：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p><p>👉&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fberezka_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram</a></p>",
